    "preamble": "State Of Gujarat vs Kantibhai Balchandbhai Patel Owner on 14 March, 2017 Author: A.G.Uraizee Bench: A.G.Uraizee R/Cr.A/438/2009 Order",
    "facts": "It appears from the communication dated 16.02.2017 addressed by Mr Ravibhai Kantibhai Patel, son of the respondent-accused, addressed to the Registrar (Judicial) of this Court that Patel Kantibhai Balchandbhai, sole respondent herein herein has expired on 26.10.2012 during the pendency of the present appeal. The aforesaid communication is accompanied by the death certificate of Patel Kantibhai Balchandbhai, issued by Talati cum Mantri of Kanthravi Gram Panchayat. Hence, in view of the death of the sole HC-NIC Page 1 of 2 Created On Wed Mar 15 State Of Gujarat vs Kantibhai Balchandbhai Patel Owner on 14 March, 2017 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/176311627/ 1 02:47:17 IST 2017 R/CR.A/438/2009",
